{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21674","headline":"三兄以白角巾寄遗发不胜冠因有感叹 · 元稹","name":"三兄以白角巾寄遗发不胜冠因有感叹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病瘴年深浑秃尽，那能胜置角头巾。\n暗梳蓬发羞临镜，私戴莲花耻见人。\n白发过於冠色白，银钉少校颔中银。\n我身四十犹如此，何况吾兄六十身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21674.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21674","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}